# NorthStar AI Customer Support Chatbot — Project Analysis

## What This Project Is

An **offline AI-powered customer support chatbot** for a fictional outdoor apparel/camping gear company. It uses local semantic NLP (no cloud APIs) and is designed to demonstrate production-grade software architecture at educational scale.

The key selling point is the **Clean Architecture with a pluggable database layer** — the SQLite demo backend can be swapped for PostgreSQL, a REST API, or an Enterprise OMS without touching any chatbot logic.

