## Architecture

The system follows a strict **layered / Clean Architecture** pattern. Dependencies flow strictly downward — no layer may skip or reverse.

```
Presentation Layer   (app.py / Streamlit UI)
        ↓
Conversation Layer   (chatbot/ — orchestrator)
        ↓
NLP Layer            (nlp/ — intent classification only)
        ↓
Business Service Layer (services/ — business rules)
        ↓
Repository / DAL     (database/ — adapter pattern)
        ↓
Persistence Layer    (SQLite → PostgreSQL → REST API)
```

### Hard Dependency Rules

| Allowed | Forbidden |
|---|---|
| UI → Conversation | UI → Database / SQL |
| Conversation → NLP | NLP → Database |
| Conversation → Services | Services → Streamlit |
| Services → Repository | Database → Streamlit |
| Repository → Database | (any layer skipping another) |

