## NLP Design

- **Model**: `sentence-transformers/all-MiniLM-L6-v2` (~80 MB, CPU-friendly)
- **Pipeline**: User message → Text normalization → MiniLM embedding → Cosine similarity vs. cached intent embeddings → Best match above threshold → Intent + confidence
- **Confidence thresholds** (configurable via `config.py`):
  - ≥ 0.80 → confident match
  - 0.60–0.79 → cautious match
  - < 0.60 → fallback
- **Embeddings are cached in memory** at startup (no repeated computation)
- Extending intents requires only updating `intents.json` — no retraining

### Intent Set

| Intent | Purpose |
|---|---|
| `greeting` | Welcome |
| `track_order` | Order status lookup |
| `return_policy` | Return & exchange info |
| `shipping_info` | Shipping options |
| `product_recommendation` | Guided product suggestions |
| `human_handoff` | Simulated live agent transfer |
| `goodbye` | Session end |
| `fallback` | Unknown / low-confidence |

